# P18 CubeGrid Grid Power like UE FCubeGrid: cell = 3.125 cm * 2^power (Power 5 = 100 cm, Power 6 = 200 cm; Power up =
# bigger cell). Starter scene, Modeling > CubeGrid at Power 5 -> Power +1 -> one 1x1 block pushed out -> Undo.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.5,-0.6,0.6
Дано run CubeGrid "CubeGrid tool"
Дано run CubeGrid "Aim at the viewport centre: on"
Дано run CubeGrid "Grid Power 5"
Когда state
Тогда 0_p5 CubeGrid active, grid cells 100 cm: the tool bar reads "Grid Power 5 - 100 cm" and the panel shows Grid Power 5 / Current Block Size 100 cm
Когда run CubeGrid "Grid Power +1"
Когда state
Тогда 1_p6 cells twice as large: tool bar "Grid Power 6 - 200 cm", the grid lines twice as far apart, same origin
Когда run CubeGrid "Select 1x1 blocks at the aim"
Когда run CubeGrid "Push/Pull out (E)"
Когда state
Тогда 2_extrude a single 200 cm block stands on the grid where the viewport centre aims
# CubeGrid records ONE undo step per session, at Accept (CubeGridTool.cpp:1238), so the block is accepted first.
Когда run CubeGrid "Accept and Start New"
Когда run Action Undo
Когда state
Тогда 3_undo the block is gone; the tool bar still reads "Grid Power 6 - 200 cm"
